# Learning Tools

## Web Lab

Your students will be engaging with **Web Lab** throughout Web Development. **Web Lab** is a browser-based editor for building web pages in HTML and CSS. It features a text editor with many helpful tools for creating and debugging HTML and CSS code, including a live preview of the web page that updates in real time and the ability to publish the complete web page to its own unique URL. 
<br>

<img src="https://images.code.org/bfcd97607e7d44515c048222619d4596-image-1777321963208.32.37 PM.png" alt="An image level in Web Lab." style="padding-left: 90px; height: 400px; clear: both; margin: 0 20px 20px 0;">

In the next level, you'll watch a video providing more information about Web Lab. This is a student-facing video, meaning your students will watch it when you teach the unit!
MARKDOWN
